# Way of the Cook (otherAreas 1): its reply kinds against The Clue accepted (a GM: Rycharde 85, Take 65, both Event; the
# lookup's action cycle plays the first container's action on a tie, and RQ2_Way_of_the_Cook sorts before RQ6_The_Clue).
# Available: Rycharde's 76 (Progress) twice; Take's 68 (Event), then 65; not due: Rycharde's 75 (Event), then 85.
# Accepted: Rycharde's 78 (Event; the cycle's last was 85, so it starts over), then 85; past EndTime: 79 (Event), then 85.
# The trade replies (73 Event, 80 / 81 Progress) have no competitor (The Clue's trade answers eggs only).
